WEBVTT

54
00:04:05.378 --> 00:04:07.539
Fatima... you came.

55
00:04:08.181 --> 00:04:10.206
You waited.

56
00:04:11.517 --> 00:04:13.041
Your CDs.

57
00:04:13.886 --> 00:04:15.285
Get on.

58
00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:18.887
Did you listen to them?

59
00:04:18.925 --> 00:04:20.153
Yes.

60
00:04:20.827 --> 00:04:22.192
They were okay.

61
00:04:23.630 --> 00:04:26.224
You have the worst taste
in music.

62
00:04:33.273 --> 00:04:35.434
Stop, Khalid.

63
00:04:35.775 --> 00:04:37.265
We can't go this way.

64
00:04:37.310 --> 00:04:38.709
It's a shortcut.

65
00:04:38.745 --> 00:04:40.576
Khalid, I said stop.

66
00:04:43.616 --> 00:04:46.244
My father has tea here
every morning.

67
00:04:49.922 --> 00:04:51.480
You see him?

68
00:04:51.858 --> 00:04:53.223
No.

69
00:04:54.327 --> 00:04:55.385
Fatima.

70
00:04:55.428 --> 00:04:56.554
Fatima, wait.

71
00:04:56.963 --> 00:04:58.225
Fatima, wait.

72
00:04:58.798 --> 00:05:00.231
I want to meet him.

73
00:05:00.667 --> 00:05:02.191
I told you, you can't.

74
00:05:02.402 --> 00:05:03.460
Has he called?

75
00:05:03.503 --> 00:05:05.630
Only to yell at me.

76
00:05:08.074 --> 00:05:10.736
We should run away, just go.

77
00:05:11.244 --> 00:05:13.041
We have our studies, Fatima.

78
00:05:14.947 --> 00:05:16.380
We have to be realistic.

79
00:05:16.416 --> 00:05:19.852
Okay for you.
No one's forcing you to marry.

80
00:05:19.886 --> 00:05:22.286
I just want to meet him.

81
00:05:22.322 --> 00:05:25.223
He has chosen someone for me.

82
00:05:26.259 --> 00:05:27.817
He has chosen.

83
00:05:28.428 --> 00:05:30.225
He might like me more.

84
00:05:34.334 --> 00:05:36.495
You don't know my father.

85
00:05:38.204 --> 00:05:39.603
Daddy.

86
00:05:43.876 --> 00:05:45.468
Daddy, did I wake you?

87
00:05:45.645 --> 00:05:47.613
No, sweetheart.

88
00:05:48.314 --> 00:05:50.908
Daddy, do you dream about me
when you're sleeping?

89
00:05:51.451 --> 00:05:52.918
I dream...

90
00:05:54.821 --> 00:05:55.879
about you...

91
00:05:56.189 --> 00:05:57.747
and your mother...

92
00:05:58.057 --> 00:06:00.184
and your sister.

93
00:06:02.028 --> 00:06:06.692
Fatima said you stop dreaming
when you get married.

94
00:06:09.001 --> 00:06:11.094
She's wrong, sweetheart.

95
00:06:12.038 --> 00:06:13.938
You dream all your life.

96
00:06:14.207 --> 00:06:16.175
It's one of God's gifts.

97
00:06:16.509 --> 00:06:17.533
Understand?

98
00:06:18.511 --> 00:06:20.638
- Give me a kiss.
- No.

99
00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:22.272
- One kiss.
- No.

100
00:06:22.315 --> 00:06:23.339
Only one.

112
00:07:28.848 --> 00:07:33.046
They overload these donkeys
and cause accidents. Chaos.

113
00:07:33.085 --> 00:07:34.109
Tea, please.

114
00:07:34.153 --> 00:07:35.381
Okay.

120
00:08:05.451 --> 00:08:07.146
Out the back! Out the back!

164
00:12:30.750 --> 00:12:33.378
19 dead, 75 injured.

165
00:12:34.120 --> 00:12:35.747
El-Hazim have
claimed responsibility.

166
00:12:36.222 --> 00:12:37.348
And the new guy?

167
00:12:38.057 --> 00:12:39.388
Shrapnel in the neck.

168
00:12:39.725 --> 00:12:40.919
He bled to death.

169
00:12:41.360 --> 00:12:42.622
Damn.

170
00:12:43.763 --> 00:12:44.889
Sir.

171
00:12:44.930 --> 00:12:46.795
You have calls
from Corrine Whitman, CIA...

172
00:12:47.199 --> 00:12:49.724
and Mr. Davis
at the U.S. State Department.

173
00:12:50.603 --> 00:12:51.763
Give me Corrine first.

174
00:12:56.909 --> 00:12:58.604
One dead American.

274
00:19:24.429 --> 00:19:25.896
Lina.

275
00:19:31.103 --> 00:19:33.901
Dad, when is Fatima
coming home?

276
00:19:37.943 --> 00:19:39.433
Finish your milk.

277
00:19:49.821 --> 00:19:52.449
Please, Abasi.

278
00:19:53.058 --> 00:19:55.322
Tell her you made a mistake.

279
00:19:56.328 --> 00:19:58.922
It's not the same
as when we were young.

280
00:19:59.131 --> 00:20:00.325
There are rules, Samia.

281
00:20:01.567 --> 00:20:02.829
There are rules.

282
00:20:03.835 --> 00:20:05.700
Look at my sister Layla.

283
00:20:05.737 --> 00:20:08.228
She'll never marry.

284
00:20:12.477 --> 00:20:14.240
Call her, Abasi.

285
00:20:15.113 --> 00:20:16.137
Please.

286
00:20:16.682 --> 00:20:18.115
For me.

287
00:20:18.417 --> 00:20:19.782
I have called.

288
00:20:19.818 --> 00:20:21.615
I've left a dozen messages.

289
00:20:21.653 --> 00:20:22.881
She doesn't answer.

290
00:20:22.921 --> 00:20:23.979
What can I do?

291
00:20:26.091 --> 00:20:28.457
Leave the egg alone!

292
00:20:29.361 --> 00:20:31.056
Have you called your father?

293
00:20:31.396 --> 00:20:32.727
Not yet.

294
00:20:34.066 --> 00:20:35.465
I'm sorry.

295
00:20:36.568 --> 00:20:39.594
Don't worry, it's nothing.

296
00:20:39.638 --> 00:20:41.868
What have I done?

297
00:20:45.877 --> 00:20:51.076
I'm proud of you
for standing up to him.

298
00:20:52.517 --> 00:20:53.984
That's my taxi.

299
00:20:54.353 --> 00:20:55.547
Please stay.

300
00:21:00.425 --> 00:21:04.327
I want you in this apartment
by eight while I'm gone.

301
00:21:05.297 --> 00:21:08.755
If my brother knew I was
leaving you here alone...

302
00:21:11.570 --> 00:21:13.060
he'd kill me.

303
00:21:13.739 --> 00:21:14.763
Okay?

304
00:21:19.111 --> 00:21:21.102
See you in a few days.

340
00:23:48.960 --> 00:23:52.555
My grandma has
the middle floor. I'm on top.

341
00:23:53.498 --> 00:23:55.625
I don't want her
to find me here.

342
00:23:55.667 --> 00:23:57.726
She's away for the week.

343
00:23:58.336 --> 00:24:01.897
I have a back way in.
No one will see us.

344
00:24:07.779 --> 00:24:09.246
You okay?

345
00:24:39.511 --> 00:24:41.308
My grandma's room.

346
00:24:43.181 --> 00:24:44.205
Come.

368
00:26:22.581 --> 00:26:23.912
Like jasmine.

369
00:26:57.882 --> 00:26:59.611
Do you sell what you paint?

370
00:26:59.784 --> 00:27:01.081
Some.

371
00:27:01.419 --> 00:27:03.683
I'm getting better.

372
00:27:09.361 --> 00:27:10.555
No.

373
00:27:11.096 --> 00:27:12.961
Those are just drafts.

374
00:27:23.041 --> 00:27:24.065
That's you?

375
00:27:26.378 --> 00:27:27.402
Mm-hmm.

376
00:27:28.079 --> 00:27:29.239
And them?

377
00:27:30.682 --> 00:27:32.912
My brother and grandma.

378
00:27:34.886 --> 00:27:36.581
This is your mother?

379
00:27:37.288 --> 00:27:39.119
She was beautiful.

380
00:27:39.891 --> 00:27:42.382
You are the beautiful one.

381
00:27:47.265 --> 00:27:50.234
You and your brother
have the same eyes.

382
00:27:50.869 --> 00:27:52.427
Where's he now?

383
00:27:55.140 --> 00:27:56.732
Does he visit you?

384
00:27:57.509 --> 00:27:58.669
No.

385
00:27:59.277 --> 00:28:00.938
Not anymore.

386
00:28:02.113 --> 00:28:03.341
Are you hungry?

387
00:28:05.884 --> 00:28:08.478
Come, let's go to the kitchen.

463
00:34:02.607 --> 00:34:04.131
- Peace be with you.
- And with you.

464
00:34:21.926 --> 00:34:24.520
I thought you weren't coming.

465
00:34:48.586 --> 00:34:49.985
Come.

466
00:34:50.688 --> 00:34:53.054
Sir, he's here.

484
00:36:35.159 --> 00:36:37.389
Al Jazeera
is running footage.

485
00:36:40.464 --> 00:36:45.766
<i>Security authorities</i>
<i>have confirmed 19 deaths.</i>

486
00:36:45.803 --> 00:36:48.966
<i>Most of the victims</i>
<i>are women and children.</i>

487
00:36:49.006 --> 00:36:52.965
<i>A tourist video</i>
<i>found at the scene...</i>

488
00:36:53.010 --> 00:36:55.342
<i>shows the source of the blast.</i>

489
00:37:03.688 --> 00:37:08.921
<i>In an email to the station,</i>
<i>El-Hazim has claimed...</i>

490
00:37:11.662 --> 00:37:13.823
Why the hell didn't we get that?

491
00:37:16.033 --> 00:37:19.127
Call Abdou, I want a copy now.

498
00:37:43.227 --> 00:37:48.028
The struggle against
the Zionist and the Crusader...

499
00:37:48.599 --> 00:37:53.036
represents the decisive battle
between faith and infidelity.

500
00:37:53.638 --> 00:37:56.505
Between good and evil.

501
00:37:57.608 --> 00:38:03.376
The destruction of the infidel
and hypocrite is your sacred duty.

502
00:38:04.615 --> 00:38:08.711
When you meet the Apostate you are
commanded to "strike the necks."

503
00:38:15.059 --> 00:38:18.051
The Crusader
talks about freedom.

504
00:38:19.930 --> 00:38:24.799
Jihad is the only path
to freedom.

505
00:38:25.136 --> 00:38:27.696
Do not fear their bullets.

506
00:38:29.140 --> 00:38:31.574
What can they do...

507
00:38:31.942 --> 00:38:34.536
but set your soul free?

508
00:38:35.479 --> 00:38:37.310
On the Day of Judgment...

509
00:38:38.482 --> 00:38:42.543
when you stand before
the Almighty God...

510
00:38:43.287 --> 00:38:45.050
and He asks you...

511
00:38:46.157 --> 00:38:49.752
"Why did you not fight
for the cause of God?

512
00:38:50.361 --> 00:38:54.457
"And for the oppressed. The men,
the women and the children?

513
00:38:58.369 --> 00:39:04.308
"What did you do
with the one weapon I gave you?

514
00:39:04.709 --> 00:39:06.734
"Your body."

515
00:39:08.112 --> 00:39:10.740
What will be your answer?

516
00:39:11.248 --> 00:39:18.416
Will you display the wounds
of martyrdom and walk through
the gates of heaven?

517
00:39:19.657 --> 00:39:27.086
Or, will you hang your head
in shame and roast in the fires of hell?

518
00:39:29.834 --> 00:39:32.667
Success is from God.

519
00:39:32.703 --> 00:39:36.104
May the peace and blessings and
glory of God, the Almighty, be upon you.

520
00:39:37.575 --> 00:39:38.974
Amen.

521
00:39:39.877 --> 00:39:41.003
Amen.

522
00:39:41.946 --> 00:39:42.935
Praise God.

523
00:39:42.980 --> 00:39:44.743
God is great!

540
00:41:19.977 --> 00:41:21.501
You are Egyptian. Yes?

541
00:41:24.615 --> 00:41:26.549
You are Egyptian.

601
00:44:47.117 --> 00:44:48.641
Put him in the hole.

633
00:49:05.943 --> 00:49:07.342
That's him.

634
00:49:07.811 --> 00:49:08.937
You see?

635
00:49:08.979 --> 00:49:10.412
Heading right for me. The dog.

636
00:49:14.251 --> 00:49:15.878
Is someone trying to stop him?

637
00:49:15.919 --> 00:49:17.045
Wait, wait.

638
00:49:17.721 --> 00:49:18.881
She's blocking him.

639
00:49:20.624 --> 00:49:22.057
The gunshot...

640
00:49:31.635 --> 00:49:34.103
Useless.

722
00:54:31.301 --> 00:54:32.529
Where were you?

723
00:54:33.436 --> 00:54:35.028
Fatima,
what are you doing here?

724
00:54:35.372 --> 00:54:36.498
I was worried.

725
00:54:36.539 --> 00:54:39.007
You can't keep missing classes.

726
00:54:39.409 --> 00:54:40.433
I was busy.

727
00:54:43.079 --> 00:54:44.376
You were busy.

728
00:54:44.814 --> 00:54:45.940
Don't.

729
00:54:46.549 --> 00:54:48.073
Are you seeing another girl?

730
00:54:51.121 --> 00:54:52.110
No.

731
00:54:52.155 --> 00:54:53.713
Then where were you?

732
00:54:53.757 --> 00:54:55.349
- With Omar.
- Where?

733
00:54:55.392 --> 00:54:57.189
At his home. He has a problem.

734
00:54:58.762 --> 00:54:59.854
I am his friend.

735
00:55:00.597 --> 00:55:01.621
Friend.

736
00:55:06.636 --> 00:55:08.297
I'm sorry.

737
00:55:11.141 --> 00:55:12.369
I have to go.

738
00:55:13.410 --> 00:55:14.434
Now?

739
00:55:14.678 --> 00:55:15.702
Stay here.

740
00:55:15.945 --> 00:55:17.105
No.

741
00:55:20.250 --> 00:55:21.274
Please...

742
00:55:21.318 --> 00:55:22.910
stay with me.

743
00:55:25.121 --> 00:55:26.281
I'm sorry.

766
00:57:47.630 --> 00:57:49.029
Leave us.

01:01:10.349 --> 01:01:11.407
Is Fatima here?

01:01:17.090 --> 01:01:18.114
There's...

01:01:19.959 --> 01:01:21.517
There's a problem, Abasi.

01:01:25.565 --> 01:01:27.692
I don't know where Fatima is.

01:01:31.604 --> 01:01:33.231
But she was staying with you.

01:01:35.608 --> 01:01:36.870
I went away...

01:01:39.245 --> 01:01:40.610
Away for work.

01:01:41.747 --> 01:01:42.907
You left her alone?

01:01:47.753 --> 01:01:49.448
When was the last time
you saw her?

01:01:50.556 --> 01:01:51.580
Six days ago.

01:01:52.091 --> 01:01:53.558
Six days ago?

01:01:55.995 --> 01:01:57.929
She's been seeing a boy.

01:01:59.232 --> 01:02:01.598
She said he was a school friend.

01:02:02.268 --> 01:02:03.667
Just a friend.

01:02:04.704 --> 01:02:05.728
What's his name?

01:02:08.474 --> 01:02:09.736
I don't know if she's with him.

01:02:09.775 --> 01:02:10.799
What's his name?

01:02:11.244 --> 01:02:12.233
Khalid.

01:02:12.278 --> 01:02:13.472
Khalid who?

01:02:13.513 --> 01:02:15.037
I don't know his last name.

01:02:19.852 --> 01:02:21.251
I'm sorry.

01:08:53.646 --> 01:08:55.011
Khalid.

01:08:55.047 --> 01:08:56.071
Smile.

01:08:58.117 --> 01:09:00.642
Wait, I want one with Fatima.

01:09:01.587 --> 01:09:03.282
Fatima. Come get in the picture.

01:09:03.722 --> 01:09:04.984
Smile.

01:09:05.724 --> 01:09:06.748
Brothers and sisters.

01:09:08.360 --> 01:09:09.691
Sorry to stop the music.

01:09:10.896 --> 01:09:13.126
I just need to make
a few points...

01:09:13.933 --> 01:09:16.493
before the march tomorrow.

01:09:17.169 --> 01:09:20.070
Remember, the streets
will be lined with police.

01:09:20.573 --> 01:09:23.371
We must remain calm.

01:09:24.843 --> 01:09:25.935
We will show the world...

01:09:27.580 --> 01:09:30.674
We will show the world
that we have had enough.

01:09:31.083 --> 01:09:32.675
That we won't take it anymore.

01:09:33.352 --> 01:09:34.250
Enough!

01:09:34.720 --> 01:09:35.744
Enough!

01:10:23.769 --> 01:10:24.793
Khalid!

01:10:25.137 --> 01:10:26.161
Khalid!

01:10:30.976 --> 01:10:32.000
Khalid!

01:10:32.277 --> 01:10:33.835
- Khalid!
- Omar!

01:10:34.313 --> 01:10:35.541
Omar!

01:10:53.098 --> 01:10:54.588
The boy's name
is Khalid El-Emin.

01:10:55.367 --> 01:10:56.732
Khalid El-Emin?

01:10:56.769 --> 01:10:58.396
I got it from the school.

01:10:59.304 --> 01:11:00.328
Father's in Paris.

01:11:00.606 --> 01:11:01.800
Mother's dead.

01:11:02.274 --> 01:11:04.139
His brother, Fadil,
had multiple arrests.

01:11:06.178 --> 01:11:07.805
We had him for a while.

01:11:08.814 --> 01:11:10.338
We let him go?

01:11:12.851 --> 01:11:15.319
He died.

01:11:25.664 --> 01:11:27.461
Where's the boy?

01:11:28.067 --> 01:11:29.091
We don't know.

01:11:29.968 --> 01:11:31.731
We're trying to find
an address for him.

01:11:33.338 --> 01:11:35.602
Then why are you standing here
like an idiot?

01:11:35.808 --> 01:11:36.832
Go!

01:11:37.543 --> 01:11:38.942
Find him!

01:11:39.812 --> 01:11:40.972
Move!

01:11:47.486 --> 01:11:49.147
Khalid, where are we going?

01:11:51.657 --> 01:11:52.817
Who is it?

01:11:52.858 --> 01:11:54.291
It's Khalid. They've taken Omar.

01:11:54.727 --> 01:11:55.887
Open, open.

01:11:59.031 --> 01:12:00.055
They took Omar.

01:12:07.172 --> 01:12:08.196
They took Omar.

01:12:14.079 --> 01:12:15.569
Go in the kitchen
and boil some water.

01:12:16.849 --> 01:12:18.874
So we can clean him up.

01:12:43.208 --> 01:12:44.732
You should not have
brought her here.

01:12:47.112 --> 01:12:49.046
What are we going to do
about her?

01:12:49.782 --> 01:12:50.874
Leave her out of it.

01:12:54.586 --> 01:12:55.746
I'm not going to her house.

01:12:56.588 --> 01:12:58.920
You've got to understand,
she is not her father.

01:13:04.463 --> 01:13:06.761
Then we will do it another way.

01:13:08.700 --> 01:13:09.724
They have Omar.

01:13:10.369 --> 01:13:11.393
They will make him talk.

01:13:12.237 --> 01:13:13.261
Over.

01:13:13.906 --> 01:13:15.464
It is over.

01:13:21.246 --> 01:13:22.235
Then...

01:13:23.982 --> 01:13:25.609
we must do it now.

01:13:31.657 --> 01:13:33.420
Remember your brother.

01:13:36.728 --> 01:13:38.923
Remember your brother.

01:21:37.375 --> 01:21:39.275
Who contacted you?

01:21:45.083 --> 01:21:46.107
How?

01:21:47.819 --> 01:21:49.616
He called me...

01:21:50.655 --> 01:21:52.122
on my cell phone.

01:27:11.309 --> 01:27:14.745
Do you know
what they will do to Omar?

01:27:18.616 --> 01:27:20.174
Do you?

01:35:27.204 --> 01:35:28.831
Sorry to wake you, sir.

01:35:29.640 --> 01:35:31.198
We have someone
who knows your daughter.

01:35:31.775 --> 01:35:33.333
Omar Adnan.

01:35:33.811 --> 01:35:36.405
He was arrested
by the riot squad last week.

01:35:37.047 --> 01:35:38.947
He knows where the boy lives.

01:36:14.818 --> 01:36:16.752
Khalid?

01:39:46.730 --> 01:39:49.699
<i>I do this in memory</i>
<i>of my brother.</i>

01:42:55.352 --> 01:42:59.550
They overload these donkeys
and cause accidents. Chaos.

01:42:59.590 --> 01:43:00.614
Tea, please.

01:43:00.657 --> 01:43:01.851
Okay.

01:43:38.095 --> 01:43:39.460
Khalid!

01:43:41.264 --> 01:43:42.629
Khalid!

01:43:44.267 --> 01:43:45.427
Khalid!

01:43:49.172 --> 01:43:50.571
Khalid!

